	(text "J1/J2 wired 1:1 (bus pass-through to the Expansion Interface), except J2 pins 14/16:\nEI_WR*/EI_RD* via JP8/JP9: 1-2 direct, or 2-3 from U3, which cuts them off for 8000-FFFF\nwhile an X-MEM card holds ECB c10 (EXTMEM*) low.\nD0-D7 go straight to the ECB slots (unbuffered); each card buffers its own data."
